# 数据库初始化脚本 - 请按顺序导入

## 1. points_rules 集合

在「数据库 → points_rules → 添加记录」中复制粘贴：

```json
{
  "_id": "default",
  "rule_id": "default",
  "register_bonus": 100,
  "daily_checkin": 10,
  "invite_bonus": 50,
  "update_time": 1717833600000
}
```

---

## 2. admins 集合

在「数据库 → admins → 添加记录」中复制粘贴：

```json
{
  "_id": "admin001",
  "admin_id": "admin001",
  "username": "admin",
  "password_hash": "admin123",
  "role": "super",
  "status": "active",
  "create_time": 1717833600000,
  "last_login_time": null
}
```

---

